 "version": "1.0.0",
 "description": "PAPER only, simulated fills, not financial advice. OPEN version: the same entry and exit rules with the holder-safety and pool-safety gates switched OFF. It exists to show what those filters are worth; expect more entries and more pulled pools. Entry: coins at least 6 h old with 500+ holders and a $10K pool; exits as S3. Rules frozen 2026-11-04; results in the docs (Published paper strategies).",
 "mode": "paper",
